window.products.push({"id":581133,"name":"Y&ME YM 2-Tier Corner Shelves for Bathroom Counter Organizer, Wood Makeup Organizer, Perfume Organizer Standing Rack, Vanity Tray for Bathroom and Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ck4w1RNxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-Quality Materials&Super Easy to Install】-Our Corner Shelf is made of 100% natural solid wood, durable and not easily deformed. High-quality metal with anti-corrosion and anti-rust can accompany you for a long time. All shelves have pre-drilled holes,it's much easier to attach without measuring, all necessary hardware is included, you only need a few minutes to assemble the great corner shelves for your room. 【Multi-Functional Countertop Organizer】-Compared with other corner shelf stand, our 2-tier bathroom counter organizer have added an additional adjustable support at the bottom to balance the load-bearing force of the boards, so that you can safely store cosmetics, facial cleanser, cotton swab, lotion, perfume, spice jars, snacks, Coffee, crystals and small plants etc., keep all things neat and organized. The non-slip foot mat at bottom can make the vanity tray stay away from water stains. 【Perfect Space Saver】-The 2-tier corner cabinet measures is 15.8\"L x 9\"Wx13.5\"H, which can save your room space to the maximum, making things well organized and orderly stored, and creating a comfortable and fashion environment for your home. This countertop orgnizer can be applied to every corner of the house to store, sort and easily access items. The handle is designed in mind, you can easily move the bathroom countertop organizer to anywhere you need. 【Stylish Design for Bathroom Decor】-Our bathroom corner organizer 2-tier shelf is designed in a scalloped shape and 90 degrees fits perfectly in the corner. It has beautiful appearance, can be non-slip, does not hurt the table. The sturdy structure and elegant design makes this a great decoration to your bathroom, living room, kitchen, office countertop and coffee bar. Maximize the use of space and perfectly match your decoration style, both beautiful and practical! You could even paint it to match your theme if you wanted. 【Great Gift Idea&Perfect Service】-This 2-tier corner storage shelf would make an ideal gift choice for organizer lovers and friends. Perfect for Christmas, Birthday, Anniversary, Mother's Day, etc. With our 100% Customer Satisfaction Guarantee, you can be sure of a great buying experience. Please do not hesitate if you have any questions or suggestions about the bathroom countertop organizer, just contact us firstly and we will reply as soon as possible within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ck4w1RNxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y&ME YM","source_asin":"B0BYJ3ZR8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYJ3ZR8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYJ3ZR8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":581134,"name":"Whales Sealife Mammals Educational Science Ocean Class Chart Print Poster 24x36","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512OffrFGmL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Cetacea order includes whales, porpoises, and dolphins. It includes 90 species, some known only by a single specimen. The whales are the most popular, so this title focuses on them. By not including the porpoises and most of the dolphins, this poster is able to present larger images and informative facts about all whale species, such as the estimated world population. The “false whales,” such as the Killer Whale, are also included, even though they are biologically classified as dolphins.Although whales are mammals, this poster does not show all of the Cetacean orders; thus it is not considered part of the Mammal series. Rather, it is part of our Sea Life series. Two scuba divers are shown in the same scale as the whales to emphasize their great size. Can you find the other one? Hint: It’s a girl in a red bathing suit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512OffrFGmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Picture Peddler","source_asin":"B01GM69TYI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GM69TYI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GM69TYI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
