window.products.push({"id":581140,"name":"BAD BANANAS Retired and Sleeping in Since 2019 - Today's Good Mood Sponsored by Retirement and Naps - Pillow Case - Funny Retirement Gifts for Men, Wo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616xNxKNO0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our pillowcases are designed to delight as the perfect gift. Brighten up a bedroom with these whimsical designs created by our small team of house elves (don't worry, we don't run a sweatshop, elf rights matter). The pillow covers are made with a zip closure, because zip closures are cool, keep the pillows inside, and don't slip off during the night. Best of all, zippers provide the best durability during a pillow fight. Our zip pillowcases are printed on both sides, because we love being awesome, and you get the added benefit of having something different on each side, which makes it almost like two gifts in one. We use dye sublimation decorating, which is a fancy way of saying the artwork actually gets dyed into the fabric, so it won't fade, crack or peel. Your gift recipient will be incredibly lucky, and should be eternally grateful for your generosity, and should be in complete awe of your wry humor and impeccable taste in gifts. You can also just get it for yourself and revel in your awesomeness!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616xNxKNO0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bad Bananas","source_asin":"B07H28G51H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H28G51H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H28G51H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
