window.products.push({"id":581568,"name":"2 Pcs Toothpaste Dispenser Automatic Toothpaste Squeezer - Wall Mounted Hands Free Toothpaste Holder for Kids and Family Washroom Bathroom Come with S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y9IWmbXfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No More Mess & Waste】Are you tired of cleaning your kids toothpaste off the mirror, walls, sink, countertop and even the whole bethroom? Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser for Kids can help you cut down on the mess and prevent over use toothpaste. With toothbrush dispenser, you don't need to worried about the cap of toothpaste lost and the top being filled with toothpaste. Kids toothpaste dispenser would help them easily get the perfect amount of toothpaste and not be so messy. 【Easy to Install】No drill, no tools, easy installation, the sticky tape has great suction power, stays to wall, easy to install new toothpaste tube. You can separate the wall mount toothpaste dispenser and sticker with a little effort. Auto toothpaste dispenser's insertion hole is suitable for almost all toothpaste tube nozzles. When inserting the toothpaste, you only need to push it in with a little effort, and then rotate it for a while. 【Easy to Use & Clean】Push the toothbrush into opening in the right spot, pull toothbrush straight back out and it has just the right amount of toothpaste on toothbrush. There have two spots, lower spot is suitable for adults, upper spot is suitable for kids. Automatic toothpaste squeezer for kids is easy to disassemble, which allows you to fully clean toothpaste dispenser. Paste dispenser much more efficient than apply toothpaste by hand. 【Durable & Safe】This toothpaste dispenser for bathroom is make of the high-quality food grade HIPS, PS and silicone, which is non-poison，odorless and harmless at high temperature. The no-trace sticker has powerful sticky, and has a good load-bearing. when sticker is dirty, wash & dry it, then it can use again. You can use all kind of toothbrush to apply the toothpaste at wall mounted dispenser, like electric & normal toothbrush with round head brush and rectangular head brush. 【Dust-proof & Portable】This easy squeeze toothpaste holder is very beautiful, dustproof and portable. You don't have to worry about the mess of toothpaste. Dustproof makes your toothpaste become more hygienic. You can bring mess free toothpaste dispenser when you travel or go on business trip. Toothpaste squeezer dispenser will make brushing your teeth in the morning easier. Size of dispenser is 3.4*3.4*3.9 inch. If you have any problem, please contact us, we have 24/7 after sale service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y9IWmbXfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chintu","source_asin":"B0B2DM5GXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DM5GXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DM5GXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
