window.products.push({"id":581845,"name":"Cooling Weighted Blanket for Adults - (15lb Twin, 48\"x72\"), Thick Quilted, Breathable Pre-Washed Microfiber Fabric, Natural Glass Beads for Calming, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KB7cnMbIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🤗GET THE BEST HUG FROM OUR BLANKET: Have trouble sleeping at night? Well, that’s because you haven’t invested in our weighted blanket yet. The twin-size adult weighted blanket with multi-layered comfort and eco-friendly filling make you feel hugged & wrapped in a gentle cocoon. The weight distributes evenly throughout for deep stimulation to calm & relax the body. Twin weighted blanket set includes: 15 lbs weighted blanket (48\" W x 72\" L) 🙌 YEAR AROUND COMFORT AND VERSATILE USE: The calming blanket is made from breathable, pre-washed microfiber fabric for ultimate comfort. You can even use it as a throw blanket for a snug feeling when lounging on the couch or in the room. The loops can be utilized to attach your favourite cover and help prevent slippage or bunched up bedding. 🧵 SAFE CHOICE AND SUPERIOR CRAFSMANSHIP - The advanced stitching technology standard and a thick 1-inch binding on the edges help prevent the loss of glass beads. The micro quilting and non-toxic glass bead filling make it heavier and facilitates a healthy sleeping experience 👋 HAVE YOU CHOSEN THE RIGHT SIZE FOR YOURSELF?: We’re here to help. If your body weight is between 130 lbs to 170 lbs, then our 15 lbs weighted cooling blanket is perfect for you. General rule of thumb is the weighted lap blanket should be 10% of the body weight 🎁 YOUR SEARCH FOR A PERFECT GIFT ENDS HERE: Looking for a perfect gift for your husband, daughter, or friend? Your search ends here! Our heavy weighted blanket twin size is the perfect gift — whatever the occasion may be. Not happy with our cool weighted blanket? It’s ok! Just let us know and we will refund or replace your order","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KB7cnMbIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleep Mantra","source_asin":"B098QYZ6GS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098QYZ6GS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098QYZ6GS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
