window.products.push({"id":581921,"name":"Avenger Dual Fuel Ventless Blue Flame Heater - 30,000 BTU, Model# FDT30BF","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ffeEhB2bL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Avenger's Dual Fuel Vent Free 30K Blue Flame Heater is built for durability and efficiency to keep your home toasty warm for many cold seasons to come. This compact but solid heater gives you a reliable source of heat. It runs at 30,000 maximum BTU which heats up to 1,400 square feet of living space. No electricity is required which is perfect for power outages or any in-house urgencies. This powerful dual fuel technology has one unit that operates on either natural gas or propane gas. Without compromising function for beauty, this versatile gas space heater has been redesigned for a slimmer and modernized profile to effortlessly fit into your home. Product Features 30,000 Maximum BTU When Using Natural Gas 30,000 Maximum BTU When Using Propane Gas Economy Level: 15,000 BTU When Using Natural Gas (Heat Settings 1,2,3) Economy Level: 24,000 BTU When Using Propane Gas (Heat Settings 1,2,3) Heats Up To 1,400 Sq. Ft. Patented DUAL FUEL TECHNOLOGY 1 Unit operates off Natural Gas or Liquid Propane Thermostat Control – The control automatically cycles the burner on and off to maintain a desired room temperature. 5 Heat Settings with micro heat adjustments between each setting! Newly redesigned cabinet for slimmer profile! Economical: 99.9% efficient. No outside duct or chimney needed! Heat for only pennies an hour! Safety Assurance: O.D.S. (Oxygen Depletion Sensor) included with automatic shut-off No electricity required to operate heater! 120V electrical outlet required if using the blower system Push Button Piezo Ignition System CSA Certified Product Dimensions: 25.7\" H x 25.5\" W x 9.84\" D Product Weight: 26.5 lbs. Ship Weight: 31.7 lbs. This Product Is Proudly Assembled in the USA Using Parts Manufactured in the USA! Designed, Engineered, Assembled and Tested in the USA. Skilled American workers manufacture parts, assemble and test our products. Only high-quality materials and parts are used in the manufacturing of our products. Our factory features state of the art manufacturing equipment. Product ships from our domestic warehouse in Kentucky, USA. What's In the Box Ventless Heater - Qty. 1 Wall Mounting Bracket - Qty. 1 Hardware Pack - Qty. 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ffeEhB2bL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avenger","source_asin":"B017WTB95G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017WTB95G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017WTB95G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":581922,"name":"Chuck Yeager Portrait 11x14 Silver Halide Photo Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AmdVsfR3L._AC_.jpg","description":"This museum grade traditional silver halide photograph is MADE IN THE USA directly from The McMahan Photo Archive's copyrighted full resolution restored originals.PHOTO DESCRIPTIONFollowing retirement from active duty, Brig. Gen. Charles Chuck Yeager continues his long relationship with the Air Force, periodically returning to fly high-performance aircraft at Edwards AFB.PHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Copyright, The McMahan Photo Archive/RMP Archive/U.S. Air Force PHOTO IMAGE DATE: 1990sIMAGE ID: AF044ABOUT OUR PHOTOGRAPHSThe McMahan Photo Archive mixes the best of today's print and restoration technologies with old fashioned hard work and artistry. People make the artistic decisions, not computers. We have printed over a million real light exposed and chemical processed silver halide prints since our start in 2001. What you are buying here is a REAL PHOTOGRAPH! At The McMahan Photo Art Gallery & Archive, you are always buying the best!Every order is backed by our 365 Day 100% RAVING FAN GUARANTEE! If your print isn't perfect, we will make it right or accept a return for a full refund. We really want you to be one of our raving fans!Robert McMahanFounder, Photographer, Historic Photo Print Expert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AmdVsfR3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The McMahan Photo Archive","source_asin":"B004GNKY12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004GNKY12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004GNKY12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
