window.products.push({"id":581977,"name":"Sempli Vaso-Sake Set, Clear Decanter and 2 Shots in Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yY24dZlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This hand blown glass set is designed to serve your favorite sake, hot or cold. The decanter comfortably fits one 350ml bottle and includes a set of two Cupa-shot sake glasses. Hand-made from lead-free crystal, their unique stemless construction creates a swirling rotation when set down—which assist the aeration of fine spirits. Set includes one decanter and two shot glasses in an elegant gift box. RECOMMENDED ACCESSORIES: Sempli’s Cupa-Stay coasters and Cupa-Lift trays are available for purchase! Use these stylish felt coasters to keep your glasses from rocking back and forth while dining! The Cupa-Lift trays are a great way to carry the glasses around with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yY24dZlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sempli","source_asin":"B00D6STXFQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D6STXFQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D6STXFQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
