window.products.push({"id":581990,"name":"Montana Woodworks Montana Collection King Bed with Storage, Clear Lacquer Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2386.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QyQios5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What could possibly be better than a classic spindle style rustic bed? A rustic spindle style bed with the storage capacity of a 6 drawer dresser. This rustic bed with storage underneath features full sized, 21\" wide, 16\" deep and 5.5\" high drawers mounted on epoxy coated steel slides for years of practical, trouble free use. This unique bed with storage is skip peeled by hand using old fashioned draw knives for a unique, one-of-a-kind look. The mortise and tenon joinery system employed by our artisans has been used for millennia to join multiple components into a single, solid and strong assembly thus ensuring a truly heirloom quality piece that will last for generations to come. Comes pre-finished with a factory applied premium grade, semi-gloss, clear lacquer finish. Some assembly required. Instructions and hardware included. 20-year limited manufacturer's warranty at no additional charge. Hand crafted in Montana U.S.A.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QyQios5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Montana Woodworks","source_asin":"B01EYLKPS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EYLKPS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EYLKPS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":581991,"name":"Luxury Gold Diamond Party & Wedding Decorations: Sparkling Acrylic Rhinestone Table Confetti Scatter Gems, Vase Filler & Centerpiece Party Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rR8Lmt5zL._AC_SL1087_.jpg","description":"💎 [IMPRESS YOUR GUESTS WITH YOUR LUXURY DIAMOND TABLE DÉCOR] These gold party decorations are a unique, elegant way to MAKE YOUR GUESTS FEEL SPECIAL, with a simple dusting of delicate diamonds on your tables for the PERFECT FINISHING TOUCH to your party or wedding. Pretty Display Diamond Confetti Table Decorations are a truly luxurious way to SPRINKLE SOME MAGIC AND SPARKLE into any celebration! 💎 [EASY & HASSLE-FREE DECORATIONS] Diamond table confetti is a quick and simple way to set an ENCHANTING, SOPHISTICATED TONE for your wedding reception or party, TRANSFORMING YOUR PARTY DECOR IN SECONDS just by sprinkling the gems onto the party tables and wedding centerpiece table decorations so you can PLAN AHEAD AND RELAX. After the party, use these exquisite golden diamond table decorations tin your home in vases, bowls or containers adding a touch of WARMTH AND GLAMOUR to any room. 💎 [UNLIKE LARGE TABLE DECORATIONS THAT CAN LOOK AWKWARD & TACKY] and which can take up too much room on the tables leaving little room for the tableware & making it difficult for conversation, these gold table décor diamonds come in a VARIETY OF SMALL, DELICATE GEM SIZES (3, 6 & 10mm) which RESEMBLE GENUINE GEMSTONES you might find in your favorite jewelry pieces. These tiny diamonds scatter softly on your tables, creating a LOVELY, SHIMMERING EFFECT without getting in the way. 💎 [CREATE BEAUTIFUL TABLE DISPLAYS WITH A TOUCH OF STYLE] Pretty Display gold party decorations are not cheap plastic beads, but are made from premium translucent acrylic which has the LUSTROUS SHEEN of glass, so they SPARKLE BEAUTIFULLY IN THE LIGHT and radiate an aura of glamour. Surprise your family, friends and colleagues with your tasteful table decorations, creating a beautiful ambiance which will DELIGHT YOUR GUESTS and set them at ease. 💎 [TURN ANY EVENT INTO A SPECIAL OCCASION] Store these versatile gold gems in the handy gauze storage bag, and use over and over again for any celebration. Scatter the gems, create a cluster of diamonds in your CENTERPIECE ARRANGEMENT or feature as a gold VASE FILLER, to customize your party and wedding table décor however you wish. Perfect for Wedding decorations for reception tables, Baby & Bridal Showers, Valentines Dinners, Birthdays, Anniversaries, Sweet 16, Proms & Birthday Parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rR8Lmt5zL._AC_SL1087_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pretty Display","source_asin":"B06Y6J3MYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-581991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y6J3MYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y6J3MYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
