window.products.push({"id":582000,"name":"What Is Your Most Valuable Possession? - Packet of 100 - KJV - No Imprinting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vw2t7zvGL._AC_.jpg","description":"\"What is your most valuable possession?\"This pointed question was asked randomly to several people at a busy intersection. The people were of various races and from all walks of life. They were students, housewives, and business people, ranging from youth to retirement age.Five of these candid replies are submitted for your most serious consideration:\"My two children and my husband\" was the reply of a middle-aged housewife, who added, \"If I didn't have them, I wouldn't have anything.\"\"My experience playing football\" was the response given by a retired salesman. Memories of victories and life lessons learned were his most cherished possessions.\"My life\" was the frank confession of a grocer. He greatly valued life itself and he lived to enjoy every day.\"My faith\" was the answer given by an earnest young man. His mother had been seriously ill, and he had faith that she would recover. \"I have my faith to fall back on.\"\"My religion\" voiced another housewife. She drew great comfort and joy from attending church and participating in its various activities.Dear reader, what would your reply be if the same question were asked of you? \"What is your most valuable possession?\" Would it be money? family? fame? health? What one thing do you value above all else? Look with me to see what the Bible says about the answers given above.A husband, child, home, and happiness therein; these are good and proper and spoken of highly in the Bible. But should they be your most valuable possession? Notice the words of Jesus Christ: \"He that loveth father or mother more than Me is not worthy of Me: and he that loveth son or daughter more than Me is not worthy of Me\" (Matthew 10:37). Does Christ take first place in your heart? Does He receive preeminence in affection?The salesman's response was rather startling. As he approached his last days after a long and busy life, he could reflect upon no greater possession than his experience in sports. Sports exer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vw2t7zvGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moments With The Book","source_asin":"B00I5VS77O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I5VS77O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I5VS77O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":582001,"name":"118Pcs Piping Bags and Tips Set,100Pcs Disposable Piping Bags,8 Plastic Piping Tips,1 Coupler and 9 Bag Ties,12 Inch Pastry Bags Icing Bags Decorating","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719GzhtlM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍬🍰 Our piping bags and tips set is a optimal choice for your daily baking. Piping bags are made of food-grade plastic.Frosting bags disposable are not need to cleanup,just toss it when done using. 🍬🍰 Perfect Package ● 100 * 12 inch disposable piping bags ● 8 * piping tips ● 1* coupler ● 9 * icing bag ties Material: Food grade TPU Silicone and PP plastic. 🍬🍰 How to use: ● Put the coupler in pastry bags cut the extra parts, Do not cut too much or your icing coupler may slip out the bottom. ● Place the tip on the coupler and use the coupler ring to secure the tip to the outside of the icing bags. Tighten the tip into the coupler. ● Use a squeegee or spoon to pick up the filling and insert it into the icing bags. Fill the bag in just 2/3 to 3/4. ● Slowly apply pressure to the bag through the hand at the top of the frosting bags until the filler begins to flow out 🍬🍰 Easy to clean & reusable Food-grade silicone icing bag ties makes it reusable many times. icing bags tips and coupler are made with premium quality PE,never bent, break or rust,reusable. 🍬🍰 Easy to Use Pastry bags can be easily trimmed and work with any decorating coupler and tips. 🍬🍰 Anti-slip Design The anti-slip rough exterior are good for gripping. 🍬🍰 Perfect for any occasion Cookies, Wedding cakes, Birthday cakes, cupcakes, office treats,hot chocolate, holiday desserts and any other sweet treats! Great decorating supplies for beginner, baker or cake decorating lover. Reminder: Manual measurement, there is a little error, which is a normal phenomenon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719GzhtlM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Visen","source_asin":"B09Y8MJ151","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-582001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8MJ151","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8MJ151","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
